# Dance Maniax 2nd Mix: power-on from blank NVRAM with the archive's (MAME 0.243) cassette dump. The BIOS reads the
# program from CD; the game then stops at ERROR 121 (cassette error 9), in MAME at the pin as here:
# that older ZS01 dump isn't the chip MAME's current dump is (docs/CATALOGUE.md, Phase 5). Hashes
# the main RAM every frame and snapshots every 60 frames, to compare HIRAKU's 573 core with MAME.
game dmx2m

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

from 0 every 60 snap
at 1800 quit
